        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Authentication&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;before_request resolves the HttpOnly cookie through a SHA-256 token lookup and checks X-CSRF-Token on POST. A missing session gives 401, a bad token 403.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Scoring&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;validate → build_features (36 columns) → both pipelines → recommendation: likely (both good), review (split), refer (both bad). Nothing is written yet.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="572.7" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Persistence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;record_scored_application inserts Applicant + Prediction; create_application inserts LoanApplication with answers, reference and tier. CSV export and audit follow.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1105.3" y="862.0" width="508.7" height="84.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Notation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:14px;color:#333333;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solid arrow, filled head&lt;/b&gt; — synchronous call, numbered in execution order&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashed arrow, open head&lt;/b&gt; — return value or response (not a new request)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Narrow bar&lt;/b&gt; — activation: the participant is executing that call&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Participant box&lt;/b&gt; — class or module taking part; the dashed line is its lifeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Numbered label&lt;/b&gt; — the position of the message in the overall sequence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt; — constraint, guard or failure path&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="970.0" width="700.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope" value="&lt;div style='font-size:9.6px;font-weight:bold;color:#8A5A2B;margin-bottom:2px;'&gt;Scope &amp;amp; conventions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:8.9px;line-height:12.2px;color:#333333;'&gt;Happy path. 400 validation, 401 no session and 403 bad CSRF or role all return before persistence. Legacy POST /api/submit calls the same submit_application(). db.py opens one transaction per helper; try_export_tables() mirrors the CSV extracts.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760.0" y="970.0" width="854.0" height="150.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
